{"unit_id":"wonderandyou__dsh-admin-mode#feature-ui-self-test","repo":"wonderandyou/dsh-admin-mode","commit":"82ae60688da59683be462c8d7134196f5def7215","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH 管理员模式的功能「聊天输入区自检」：客户端在加载后 1.5 秒和 4 秒检查 composer 是否存在且尺寸正常，将结果提交到 /admin-mode/selftest，并在失败时停用自身 UI。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:844-879","index.js:221-237"]}
